{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lo-fi beats to fold to.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of the chill tracks featured in Paper 2 - Origami Refolded. These tracks have a calm, but focused mood - definitely downtempo, but not necessarily ambient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that while the game has a layered music system that procedurally changes as you fold, the songs in this soundtrack are faithful renderings that capture the vibes of the 7 distinct tracks included in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the tracks are purely instrumental, without lyrics or vocals, with tempos in the range of 76 to 91 BPM provided as 192kbps MP3 files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The total runtime of all tracks combined is 23 minutes, 46 seconds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572790?t=1742922035","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572790?t=1742922035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572790/862e338cf072a49b7bb07ff421c22563a7e0bf5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742922035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572790/862e338cf072a49b7bb07ff421c22563a7e0bf5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742922035","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lo-fi beats to fold to.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of the chill tracks featured in Paper 2 - Origami Refolded. These tracks have a calm, but focused mood - definitely downtempo, but not necessarily ambient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that while the game has a layered music system that procedurally changes as you fold, the songs in this soundtrack are faithful renderings that capture the vibes of the 7 distinct tracks included in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the tracks are purely instrumental, without lyrics or vocals, with tempos in the range of 76 to 91 BPM provided as 192kbps MP3 files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The total runtime of all tracks combined is 23 minutes, 46 seconds.</p>","developers":["Bryce Summer"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3250730","name":"Paper 2 - Origami Refolded"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572790/681efd833d9752bf915c6c04e5c7a8a6848ab87c/header.jpg?t=1742922035","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Paper 2 - Origami Refolded Soundtrack","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Paper 2 - Origami Refolded Soundtrack - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$1.99</span> $0.89 USD","packageid":1260566,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-55% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":89}],"title":"Buy Paper 2 - Origami Refolded Soundtrack"}],"packages":[1260566],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 35 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":true,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":55,"final":89,"final_formatted":"$0.89 USD","initial":199,"initial_formatted":"$1.99"},"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"25 Mar, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572790/bb00800873308b12bb757cf555b2